-Scream.

2613
01:25:55,742 --> 01:25:58,079
-Scream.
-Scream.

2614
01:25:58,079 --> 01:25:59,537
ALICIA: [SCREAMS]
-Good.

2615
01:25:59,537 --> 01:26:02,442
-That's cue.

2616
01:26:02,442 --> 01:26:03,321
-Alley-oop.

2617
01:26:03,321 --> 01:26:05,039
Give and go.

2618
01:26:05,039 --> 01:26:05,847
-Appreciate the help.

2619
01:26:05,847 --> 01:26:06,716
-Any time.

2620
01:26:06,716 --> 01:26:08,204
-Listen, pal.

2621
01:26:08,204 --> 01:26:09,342
-Pull my finger.

2622
