Get out.

2639
01:26:37,591 --> 01:26:38,810
Come on.
You're on your way.

2640
01:26:38,810 --> 01:26:39,309
-Come on.
-You're on your way.

2641
01:26:39,309 --> 01:26:41,346
-Come on.
-You're on your way.
-You're on your way.
-Hurry up.

2642
01:26:41,346 --> 01:26:41,606
-You're on your way.
-Hurry up.

2643
01:26:41,606 --> 01:26:43,713
My parents will be
home in 10 minutes.

2644
01:26:43,713 --> 01:26:45,240
-Sure hope somebody
grabbed that chicken.

2645
01:26:45,240 --> 01:26:47,317
-Move it.
Come on.

2646
01:26:47,317 --> 01:26:49,764
