climbing down a rosary.

2725
01:29:32,248 --> 01:29:32,747
-Yup.

2726
01:29:32,747 --> 01:29:37,171
-Yup.
-Ow.

2727
01:29:37,171 --> 01:29:37,950
-Ow.

2728
01:29:37,950 --> 01:29:39,597
It's the knots
that-- ouch. ouch.

2729
01:29:39,597 --> 01:29:40,386
Oh, rope burns.

2730
01:29:40,386 --> 01:29:51,191
Oh.

2731
01:29:51,191 --> 01:29:53,368
-Now, let's go home, friend.

2732
01:29:53,368 --> 01:29:57,961
-Ow.

2733
01:29:57,961 --> 01:29:58,510
Be careful.

2734
01:29:58,510 --> 01:29:59,648
