Ninja" fly Air America.

2755
01:30:37,484 --> 01:30:40,859
-Glad they weren't early.

2756
01:30:40,859 --> 01:30:43,165
-One Adam-12, stop the movie.
-Please.

2757
01:30:43,165 --> 01:30:44,004
