had a good time.

2794
01:31:49,299 --> 01:31:50,248
-D'oh!

2795
01:31:50,248 --> 01:31:54,352
-Oh, Master Ninja,
will you ever learn?

2796
01:31:54,352 --> 01:31:55,700
Well, let's get going.

2797
01:31:55,700 --> 01:31:56,349
-I'm going to stay.

2798
01:31:56,349 --> 01:31:57,977
