-Sing the theme song here.

2799
01:32:02,331 --> 01:32:05,835
-(SINGING) He's a
man with a plan.

2800
01:32:05,835 --> 01:32:06,684
He's a ninja.

2801
01:32:10,259 --> 01:32:14,203
You've got to go where
the hamster goes.

2802
01:32:14,203 --> 01:32:15,951
You're a ninja.

2803
01:32:15,951 --> 01:32:17,878
Uh, Joel.
Joel.

2804
01:32:17,878 --> 01:32:18,837
Joel!

2805
01:32:18,837 --> 01:32:19,785
Carry me.

2806
01:32:19,785 --> 01:32:21,183
-OK.
What, are you sick of this?

2807
01:32:21,183 --> 01:32:25,008
-(SINGING) He's got
thighs like a hamster.

2808
01:32:25,008 --> 01:32:25,787
Hoo.
Ha.

2809
01:32:25,787 --> 01:32:26,765
